---
import Nav from "./Nav.astro";
import StoryLine from "./StoryLine.astro";
---

<aside class="sticky top-0 z-20 h-svh">
  <div class="flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col">
    <Nav />

    <section
      class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden py-16 lg:py-0"
      aria-label="Landing page copy"
    >
      <div
        class="copy-viewport h-full w-full overflow-hidden opacity-0 data-ready:opacity-100"
        data-copy-viewport
      >
        <div class="copy-gradient">
          <div
            class="copy-track max-w-none space-y-2 text-[clamp(0.9rem,1.08vw,1.12rem)] leading-[1.45] tracking-normal md:space-y-2.5"
            data-copy-lines
          >
            <StoryLine id="hero-simple">
              software should feel simple.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-arrive" spaced>
              ideas rarely arrive neatly.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-people" spaced>
              they move through people before they move through systems.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-detail">
              someone points to a detail, refers back to something,
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-frame">
              changes the frame, or notices what was missing.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-motion" spaced>
              good software should understand that kind of motion.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-natural">
              it should feel natural to use, clear enough to trust,
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="mission-quiet">
              and quiet enough to let the work stay in front.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="contact-complex" spaced>
              bring me the complex idea.
            </StoryLine>
            <StoryLine id="contact-simple" spaced>
              i'll turn it into simple software.
            </StoryLine>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .copy-viewport {
    --copy-core-half-height: 4rem;
    --copy-falloff-half-height: 50svh;
    --copy-mask-center: 50%;

    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      transparent
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) - var(--copy-falloff-half-height)),
      rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4)
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) - var(--copy-core-half-height)),
      black var(--copy-mask-center),
      rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4)
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) + var(--copy-core-half-height)),
      transparent
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) + var(--copy-falloff-half-height)),
      transparent 100%
    );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      transparent
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) - var(--copy-falloff-half-height)),
      rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4)
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) - var(--copy-core-half-height)),
      black var(--copy-mask-center),
      rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4)
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) + var(--copy-core-half-height)),
      transparent
        calc(var(--copy-mask-center) + var(--copy-falloff-half-height)),
      transparent 100%
    );
    -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    -webkit-mask-size: 100% 100%;
    mask-size: 100% 100%;
  }

  .copy-gradient {
    display: flow-root;
    height: 100%;
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .copy-track {
    --copy-offset: 0px;

    transform: translate3d(0, var(--copy-offset), 0);
    will-change: transform;
  }
</style>
